## Legacy styling (do not extend unless fixing that area)

`.btn` (neon-green), `.mdc-*` form classes, and `musicbizqr` in `layouts/default.vue` title template are legacy MBQ-era patterns. Match current Faneqo homepage and band-page quality instead.
